{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_xFRCDRkumF3ckgUPimaOCHkU","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n3\t  \"title\": \"verdict-artifact\",\n4\t  \"description\": \"autonomous-mode.md 机件 #3 的验收工件 schema。verify 每轮必产 docs/test-reports/{BL-id}-verdict.json，喂沉淀引擎（§8.4）。存在≠真实：每 feature 的 evidence / steps_to_reproduce 必须非空，机械拒收空壳 PASS。v1.1 起兼作 dispatch-mode.md 的跨厂商交付契约（deliverable.schema），并承载 waiting 中断态。\",\n5\t  \"type\": \"object\",\n6\t  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n7\t  \"required\": [\"batch_id\", \"fix_round\", \"created_at\", \"verdicts\"],\n8\t  \"properties\": {\n9\t    \"batch_id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"= progress.json.current_sprint（BL-id）\" },\n10\t    \"fix_round\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0 },\n11\t    \"created_at\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" },\n12\t    \"waiting\": {\n13\t      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n14\t      \"enum\": [\"auth\", \"adjudication\", null],\n15\t      \"default\": null,\n16\t      \"description\": \"dispatch-mode.md 的中断态降维表达（借 A2A AUTH_REQUIRED / INPUT_REQUIRED 语义）。一次性 CLI 进程无法「挂起等你」，故把中断态编码进产物：撞 L2 边界而未获授权 → 'auth'；规格歧义 / acceptance 无法客观判定 → 'adjudication'。写完照常 exit 0——不要用非零退出码表达「我需要人」，那会被回执推断判成 FAILED 并触发无意义重派。编排者读到非空即硬停交人类。\"\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"waiting_detail\": {\n19\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n20\t      \"minLength\": 1,\n21\t      \"description\": \"waiting 非空时必填：卡在哪条 feature、需要什么授权或裁决。人类据此一眼判断如何解锁\"\n22\t    },\n23\t    \"verdicts\": {\n24\t      \"type\": \"array\",\n25\t      \"items\": {\n26\t        \"type\": \"object\",\n27\t        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n28\t        \"required\": [\"feature_id\", \"result\", \"evidence\", \"steps_to_reproduce\"],\n29\t        \"properties\": {\n30\t          \"feature_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n31\t          \"result\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"PASS\", \"PARTIAL\", \"FAIL\"] },\n32\t          \"evidence\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"description\": \"实测证据（测试输出/命令/staging 结果），非空——空 = 空壳，拒收\" },\n33\t          \"steps_to_reproduce\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 }\n34\t        }\n35\t      }\n36\t    }\n37\t  },\n38\t  \"if\": {\n39\t    \"properties\": { \"waiting\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"auth\", \"adjudication\"] } },\n40\t    \"required\": [\"waiting\"]\n41\t  },\n42\t  \"then\": {\n43\t    \"_comment\": \"中断态下允许 verdicts 为空或部分——被授权/裁决卡住时本就验不完，强行要求满额会逼出编造的证据\",\n44\t    \"required\": [\"waiting_detail\"],\n45\t    \"properties\": { \"verdicts\": { \"minItems\": 0 } }\n46\t  },\n47\t  \"else\": {\n48\t    \"_comment\": \"非中断态：verdicts 必须非空，否则这轮验收没有产出，沉淀引擎无燃料\",\n49\t    \"properties\": { \"verdicts\": { \"minItems\": 1 } }\n50\t  }\n51\t}"}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_wvPPqd9YwwkHL16c0N4bQBXu","content":"1\t# BL-COMPOSE-VERSION-SHAPE: supporting diagnosis only\n2\t\n3\t## Authority and decisive evidence\n4\t\n5\tThe Coordinator uses null-binding Planner compatibility. This is a section 1.5\n6\tsupporting diagnosis, not a canonical feature or release signoff. Base is\n7\t917b60c (the retained actual result of protected run 37844242857). That run was\n8\thuman-approved and refused at compose_unavailable with invalid_version,\n9\tpipeline_exit_status=0, captured_bytes=27 and home_present=false. The retained\n10\tstring's syntax is unknown. Do not guess a vendor prefix, distro suffix, HOME\n11\tcause, missing plugin or timeout. release_ready remains false.\n12\t\n13\t## Narrow new scope\n14\t\n15\tAn isolated Generator may edit only:\n16\t\n17\t1. scripts/ci/vps-host-preflight.sh: pure bounded classification of the existing\n18\t   retained Compose string, its initialization and report serialization.\n19\t2. .github/workflows/deploy-vps.yml: only the existing host-preflight jq validator\n20\t   to accept and strictly validate one required compose_version_shape field.\n21\t3. tests/ci/vps-host-preflight-observability.test.ts: only its scope-normalization\n22\t   pins, old-report comparison stripping, and the five synthetic acceptance\n23\t   fixtures in `validates each fixed classification` for the newly allowed field.\n24\t   The previous diagnostic test's exact serialization/source pins must explicitly\n25\t   account for this added scope. Add consistent shape objects/nulls to those\n26\t   five fixtures. The old ok/captured_bytes=0 fixture is impossible for its\n27\t   nonempty accepted version; replace only that count with the byte length of\n28\t   body.versions.compose, and add a new explicit rejection control for the\n29\t   former impossible combination. Preserve all other compose_probe values,\n30\t   functional expectations, test count, caps, timeouts and rejection cases. This is an explicit\n31\t   scope extension; never claim that no existing diagnostic test changed.\n32\t4. New tests/ci/vps-compose-version-shape.test.ts, this spec and artifacts under\n33\t   docs/test-reports/BL-COMPOSE-VERSION-SHAPE-20261009/.\n34\t\n35\tAll 43 original host-preflight tests, all other old tests/fixtures/assertions,\n36\tproduct code, dependencies, state machines, rules, credentials and prior evidence\n37\tare frozen. Every workflow byte outside the existing validator is frozen.\n38\tExisting compose_probe (its exact four keys), shared query(), capture argv,\n39\tcapture order, version acceptance regex, failure reason/outcome, versions fields,\n40\t5s/16384-byte query bound, 16385-byte detector and 150s/65536-byte SSH/report\n41\tbounds are frozen. No fallback, plugin search/install, HOME/environment restoration,\n42\tconfig read/write, additional host queries, Docker operation, DB operation or\n43\truntime mutation. No worker push, GH production API, SSH or credential access.\n44\t\n45\t## Fixed shape contract\n46\t\n47\tAdd required compose_version_shape to full reports; minimal missing-jq report is\n48\tunchanged. It is null before successful bounded capture, on nonzero pipeline or\n49\toutput overflow. Otherwise it is an exact object, computed from that same retained\n50\tstring (never total emitted stdout/stderr):\n51\t\n52\t- prefix: empty, numeric, v_numeric, docker_compose_version, other. numeric means\n53\t  a decimal digit at byte zero; v_numeric means literal v followed by a digit;\n54\t  docker_compose_version means exact literal `Docker Compose version ` at zero.\n55\t- core_present: Boolean. For numeric/v_numeric or the exact fixed vendor prefix,\n56\t  recognize only a leading optional-v decimal major.minor.patch. Do not serialize\n57\t  any matched component. Remove only the exact fixed vendor prefix from a local\n58\t  classification candidate before core parsing, without modifying the captured\n59\t  value. No core parsing for other/empty prefix.\n60\t- tail_bytes: null without a parsed core; otherwise retained bytes following the\n61\t  core, integer 0..16384. Preserve bytes; do not trim or normalize.\n62\t- tail_charset: not_parsed without a core; empty for zero tail; legacy for nonempty\n63\t  [a-zA-Z0-9.+-]+; legacy_plus_tilde for the same alphabet plus ~ and at least one\n64\t  ~; legacy_plus_underscore similarly plus _; legacy_plus_tilde_underscore for both;\n65\t  other otherwise. This classifies, not accepts, a version or distro suffix.\n66\t- has_cr, has_lf, has_horizontal_space, has_escape, has_non_ascii: Booleans over\n67\t  the complete retained string. Horizontal space means literal ASCII space or tab;\n68\t  escape means byte 0x1b; non-ASCII means any retained byte outside 0x00..0x7f.\n69\t\n70\tClassification must be byte-based and locale-independent without changing the\n71\tambient locale of any existing query. Only pure bounded shell operations may\n72\tinspect the retained string; no new external query. Report only these fixed labels,\n73\tcounts and flags, never the raw string, regex captures, arbitrary prefix/tail,\n74\tindividual byte codes, stderr, environment values, HOME/path/config contents,\n75\thashes or secrets. Never use shape metadata to allow an otherwise refused version.\n76\t\n77\tThe validator must enforce exact keys/types/enums/counts: no core for other/empty\n78\tprefix; absent core means null tail_bytes/not_parsed; present core means a\n79\tnumeric/v_numeric/vendor prefix and integer tail_bytes <= captured_bytes and\n80\tno not_parsed class; zero tail means empty and vice versa. An empty prefix means\n81\tcaptured_bytes=0 and all flags false; a nonempty prefix means captured_bytes>0.\n82\tThe shape is null exactly for not_run/command_failed/output_bound_exceeded, and\n83\tan object exactly for ok/invalid_version. For ok require numeric/v_numeric,\n84\tcore_present=true, tail_bytes<=32, empty/legacy tail class, all flags false, and\n85\tcaptured_bytes equal to the ASCII byte length of versions.compose. These are\n86\tadditional consistency guards, never a relaxed version acceptance rule.\n87\tReject extra fields and inconsistent shape vs compose_probe, preserve\n88\tevery existing report allowlist and never treat diagnostic execution as release.\n89\t\n90\t## Independent controls and publication boundary\n91\t\n92\tRetain every initial failed command/log. Preserve and run the existing 43 host\n93\tand 32 observability controls. New controls must cover every prefix/tail class,\n94\tCR/LF/space/tab/escape/non-ASCII, multibyte locale byte counts, valid and invalid\n95\tversions, command failure, oversized output, hung bounded capture, secret canaries,\n96\tunchanged argv/queries/refusal point and exact workflow validator negative cases.\n97\tPin all frozen script/workflow bytes and old-test blobs mechanically. Scope critic\n98\treviews before and after; fresh registered Kimi-family Evaluator independently\n99\ttests the exact source commit locally. Same-family scope review is not functional\n100\tacceptance. Evaluator originals are transported without rewriting.\n101\t\n102\tOnly after those supporting checks may the Coordinator publish an exact reviewed\n103\tcommit to a non-main CI ref and dispatch operation=host-preflight. Every new run\n104\trequires actual human production-environment approval. All normal verification,\n105\tOCI/recovery and Deploy jobs must remain skipped. Prior approvals do not approve\n106\tnew exact-source protected runs. No main push/deployment/bootstrap is enabled."}
